101
00:05:14,049 --> 00:05:18,396
While the team maintains the product,
the platform tells the agent what changed

102
00:05:18,433 --> 00:05:20,797
and helps it move off old versions.

103
00:05:21,407 --> 00:05:25,747
And at release, the agent che-checks
the work against the current

104
00:05:25,747 --> 00:05:28,324
rules before anything ships.

105
00:05:28,545 --> 00:05:30,890
So the rules show up where work starts.

106
00:05:31,213 --> 00:05:33,611
Team integrates the
right way from day one.

107
00:05:33,629 --> 00:05:40,305
So let's say a layout in China changes
from s-- today it's bottom up, which

108
00:05:40,305 --> 00:05:45,437
means if you take an address, it
starts with the highest administrative

109
00:05:45,476 --> 00:05:50,031
area, which is country, then state,
city, and so on and so forth, which

110
00:05:50,031 --> 00:05:54,796
is in contrast to what we have here in
the West, where addresses start with

111
00:05:54,816 --> 00:05:59,674
the smallest unit, which is a street
name, apartment number, city, state,

